@startuml
actor Student
participant ConsoleMenu
participant EducationPlatformFacade
participant QuizService
participant GradeService
participant StudentNotificationObserver
participant CourseProgress
participant CertificateDecorator
Student -> ConsoleMenu : choose Complete Quiz
ConsoleMenu -> EducationPlatformFacade : submitQuiz(student, course, answers)
EducationPlatformFacade -> QuizService : submitQuiz(...)
QuizService -> GradeService : recordGrade(grade)
GradeService -> StudentNotificationObserver : onGradePublished(grade)
StudentNotificationObserver -> Student : receiveNotification
QuizService --> EducationPlatformFacade : saved Grade
EducationPlatformFacade --> ConsoleMenu : Grade
Student -> ConsoleMenu : finish remaining lessons, request certificate
ConsoleMenu -> EducationPlatformFacade : progress(student, course)
EducationPlatformFacade --> ConsoleMenu : actual completion percent
ConsoleMenu -> EducationPlatformFacade : requestCertificate(student, course)
EducationPlatformFacade -> CertificateDecorator : issueCertificate(student, progress)
CertificateDecorator -> CertificateDecorator : check enrollment and 100%; reuse prior issuance
CertificateDecorator --> EducationPlatformFacade : Certificate or empty
EducationPlatformFacade --> ConsoleMenu : result
@enduml
